### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/health

### Context estimate, harness9 Context Engineering style
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/context/estimate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "这里放一段待估算上下文文本",
  "context_window": 1000
}

### Create session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project_id": "p_001",
  "title": "阶段一单框闭环",
  "capacity_limit": 1000,
  "used_units": 760,
  "summary": "已完成 Langfuse 主平台决策、Context Engineering 范围收窄和业务闭环骨架。",
  "open_todos": ["完善前端管理台", "接入真实 Langfuse API"],
  "decisions": ["Langfuse 作为 LLMOps 主平台", "harness9 只取 Context Engineering"],
  "risks": ["后续需要真实 LLM 生成质量评估"],
  "created_by": "u_001"
}

### Add context usage by text
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/sessions/sess_REPLACE_ME/context-usage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "新增的一轮上下文文本",
  "actor_id": "u_001"
}

### Record compaction
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/sessions/sess_REPLACE_ME/compactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "summary": "压缩摘要：保留 Langfuse 主平台、Context Engineering 和自研业务闭环决策。",
  "tokens_before": 860,
  "tokens_after": 80,
  "messages_before": 24,
  "messages_after": 4,
  "actor_id": "u_001"
}

### Capacity events
GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/sessions/sess_REPLACE_ME/capacity-events
X-Actor-Id: u_001

### Create work-report prompt template
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/prompts/templates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt_code": "work_report",
  "scope_level": "project",
  "scope_id": "p_001",
  "name": "工作汇报生成指令",
  "description": "对话框收口时生成工作汇报文件。",
  "owner_id": "u_001"
}

### Create prompt version with Langfuse binding metadata
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/prompts/templates/pt_REPLACE_ME/versions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "请基于会话摘要、决策、待办和风险生成工作汇报。",
  "variables_schema": {
    "session": "object"
  },
  "change_note": "初始版本",
  "created_by": "u_001",
  "platform_binding": {
    "platform": "langfuse",
    "platform_prompt_name": "work-report",
    "platform_version": "v1",
    "sync_status": "planned"
  }
}

### Publish prompt version
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/prompts/versions/pv_REPLACE_ME/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "u_001"
}

### Create handoff-file prompt template
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/prompts/templates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt_code": "handoff_file",
  "scope_level": "project",
  "scope_id": "p_001",
  "name": "工作交接文件生成指令",
  "description": "对话框收口时生成给下一个对话框读取的工作交接文件。",
  "owner_id": "u_001"
}

### Close session: generate report and handoff file
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/sessions/sess_REPLACE_ME/close
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor_id": "u_001"
}

### List generated files
GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/artifacts/files?project_id=p_001
X-Actor-Id: u_001

### List Langfuse-style traces
GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/langfuse/traces?project_id=p_001
X-Actor-Id: u_001

### Score trace
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/langfuse/traces/trace_REPLACE_ME/score
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 0.92,
  "score_reason": "工作汇报和交接文件已生成，且关联到了提示词版本。",
  "actor_id": "u_001"
}

